1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,478
Empty input at the prompt

2
00:00:03,478 --> 00:00:06,500
Type 'alpha beta' (cursor at end)

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,546
Ctrl-Y: all text left of the cursor is deleted

4
00:00:09,546 --> 00:00:13,633
Clear input, type 'kill-u-sentinel' (cursor at end)

5
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:16,631
Ctrl-U: the text is removed

6
00:00:16,631 --> 00:00:19,701
Ctrl-Y: input stays empty, 'kill-u-sentinel' is not restored

7
00:00:19,701 --> 00:00:23,800
Clear input, type 'kill-k-sentinel', Home moves the cursor to the start

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,759
Ctrl-K: the text is removed

9
00:00:26,759 --> 00:00:29,826
Ctrl-Y: input stays empty, 'kill-k-sentinel' is not restored

10
00:00:29,826 --> 00:00:33,700
Clear input, type 'first second' (cursor at end)

11
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,800
Ctrl-W: the word 'second' is removed

12
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,778
Ctrl-Y: 'first ' is deleted too, 'second' is not restored

13
00:00:39,778 --> 00:00:42,467
Clear input: end of the demo

